      "block": {
        "type": "text",
        "label": "READING · MY NEIGHBORHOOD",
        "html": "My name is Paula, and I live in a small apartment in Pinheiros, in São Paulo. My building is <b>on the corner of</b> a quiet street, <b>opposite</b> a small park. <b>Next to</b> my building there is a bakery, and I buy bread there every morning. <b>Between</b> the bakery and the pharmacy, there is a little café with tables <b>on</b> the sidewalk.<br><br>I work <b>in</b> an office <b>near</b> Avenida Paulista, so I usually take the subway. The subway station is only five minutes from my home, <b>behind</b> the supermarket.<br><br>But today is Saturday, and I am not working. Right now, I am sitting at a table <b>in front of</b> the café. I am drinking a coffee and I am reading a book. In the park, some children are playing football and an old man is walking his dog. It's sunny, and my neighborhood looks beautiful today."
      }
    },
